   Norris, D. Ryan, Univ Guelph, Dept Integrat Biol, Guelph, ON, Canada.
   Norris, D. Ryan, Nat Conservancy Canada, Toronto, ON, Canada.
   Hu, Lihai; Bataille, Clement P., Univ Ottawa, Dept Earth \& Environm Sci, Ottawa, ON, Canada.},
